     Truoc do mo o canh1 "Truc duong vao".
     ⚠️ Canh mo dau do RIENG dong nay quyet, KHONG theo thu tu nut o canh.json
     (thu tu nut da de Flycam tong quan dung dau tu 15/09 ma tour van mo canh1 —
     treo mat mot ngay vi tuong hai thu di chung).
     ⚠️ Ten scene van la `canh2_vong_xoay_loi_vao` va title van "Vong xoay loi vao":
     doi id scene la MAN DEN. Ten khach thay lay tu canh.json. Dung "don" cho khop. -->
<action name="startup" autorun="onstart">
  loadscene(canh2_vong_xoay_loi_vao, null, MERGE);
</action>

